       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID.    SWI99500.
      ******************************************************************
      *     PROGRAMA SWI99500.                                    *
      *                                                                *
      *     Total de operaçoes por correspondente
      ******************************************************************
      *     LOG ALTERACOES:                                            *
      *   USER     / DATA     /   REFERENCIA / OBSERVACOES             *
      *                                                                *
      *                                                                *
      ******************************************************************
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       CONFIGURATION SECTION.
       DATA DIVISION.
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       01  FILLER                          PIC X(40) VALUE
           'INICIO WORKING-STORAGE SWI99500         '.
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *            DECLARACOES DE DB2
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
           EXEC SQL INCLUDE SWCD5805 END-EXEC.
           EXEC SQL INCLUDE TBCDCCBC END-EXEC.
           EXEC SQL INCLUDE SQLCA    END-EXEC.
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *            MENSAGEM DE INPUT E  OUTPUT
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       COPY SWCV9950.
       COPY SWCV9951.
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *            AREAS DE TRABALHO
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       COPY VIAL0015.
       COPY VIAW0005.
       COPY VIAK0001.
       COPY VIAK0002.
       COPY SWCK0001.
       COPY SWCK0002.
       COPY ARCK0002.
      *
       COPY ARCL0039.
       COPY ETCL0002.
       COPY SXCL0790.
       COPY VIAW0020.
       COPY TGCL1000.
       COPY SXCL0002.
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *            AREAS DE TRABALHO
      *--------------------------------------------------------------

      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *            SWITCH
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       01  SW-SWITCH.
           05 SW-CURSOR                  PIC X(01) VALUE SPACES.
              88 SW-CURSOR-NONE                    VALUE '0'.
              88 SW-CURSOR-1                       VALUE '1'.
              88 SW-CURSOR-2                       VALUE '2'.
              88 SW-CURSOR-3                       VALUE '3'.
              88 SW-CURSOR-4                       VALUE '3'.
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *            CONSTANTES
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       01  WS-CONSTANTES.
           05 CON-NCCCBCOR PIC X(08) VALUE 'NCCCBCOR'.
           05 CON-SWVT5805 PIC X(08) VALUE 'SWVT5805'.
           05 CON-BANC-MIN PIC X(04) VALUE '    '.
           05 CON-BANC-MAX PIC X(04) VALUE '9999'.
           05 CON-SEND-MIN PIC X(02) VALUE '  '.
           05 CON-SEND-MAX PIC X(02) VALUE '99'.
           05 CON-VALIDO   PIC X(01) VALUE 'V'.
           05 CON-PD       PIC X(02) VALUE 'PD'.
           05 CON-RS       PIC X(02) VALUE 'RS'.
           05 CON-RC       PIC X(02) VALUE 'RC'.
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *            PROGRAM CONTROL
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       01  WS-PROGRAM-CONTROL.
           05 WS-PROGNAME     PIC  X(08) VALUE 'SWI99500'.
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *              DECLARACOES DE CURSORES DB2                     *
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       01  WS-SQL-AUXILIARY.
           05 IND-NULL                  PIC S9(04)    BINARY.
      *
       01  WS-CURSOR-VARS.
           05 WS-CSEND.
              10 WS-CBAN                PIC  X(04)    VALUE SPACES.
              10 WS-CSPAI               PIC  X(02)    VALUE SPACES.
              10 FILLER                 PIC  X(09)    VALUE SPACES.
           05 WS-COUNT                  PIC S9(09)V   COMP-3.
           05 WS-SUM                    PIC S9(15)V99 COMP-3.
           05 WS-CODEST1                PIC  X(02)    VALUE SPACES.
           05 WS-CODEST2                PIC  X(02)    VALUE SPACES.

           EXEC SQL
                DECLARE CURSWT01 CURSOR FOR
                 SELECT NCCCBALC
                      , NCCCCCB
                      , NCCCMOED
                 FROM NCCCBCOR
                 WHERE NCCCCBAN  = :NCCCBCOR-NCCCCBAN
                   AND NCCCCSPAI = :NCCCBCOR-NCCCCSPAI
                   AND NCCCMOED >= :NCCCBCOR-NCCCMOED
                 ORDER BY NCCCMOED
           END-EXEC.

      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       01  FILLER                        PIC X(40) VALUE
           'FIM DA WORKING-STORAGE SWI99500         '.
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       LINKAGE SECTION.
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *
       COPY VIAL0004.
      *
            EXEC SQL INCLUDE VIAP0009 END-EXEC.
      *
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *            0000-MAINLINE
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       0000-MAINLINE.
      *
           PERFORM 1000-INICIO-PROGRAMA
              THRU 1099-INICIO-PROGRAMA-EXIT.

           PERFORM 2000-PROC-PROGRAMA
              THRU 2099-PROC-PROGRAMA-EXIT.

           PERFORM 3000-FINAL-PROGRAMA
              THRU 3099-FINAL-PROGRAMA-EXIT.
      *
       0099-MAINLINE-EXIT.
           COPY VIAP0004.
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *            1000-INICIO-PROGRAMA
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       1000-INICIO-PROGRAMA.
      *
           IF VIAL0001-DEBUG-SIM
              MOVE '1000-INICIO-PROGRAMA' TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID
              PERFORM VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.
      *
           MOVE VIAL0001-MENSAGEM-INPUT    TO SWCV9950-MSG.
           MOVE SWCV9950-ASE               TO SWCV9951-ASE.
      *
           MOVE ZEROES                     TO SWCV9951-INDICE.
           PERFORM 1100-LIMPA-OCCURS
              THRU 1199-LIMPA-OCCURS-EXIT
             UNTIL SWCV9951-PAGINA-CHEIA.
      *
       1099-INICIO-PROGRAMA-EXIT.
           EXIT.
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *            1100-LIMPA-OCCURS
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       1100-LIMPA-OCCURS.
      *
           ADD 1                       TO SWCV9951-INDICE.
           MOVE SPACES
             TO SWCV9951-D-CSEND(SWCV9951-INDICE)
           MOVE SPACES
             TO SWCV9951-D-DESCSEND(SWCV9951-INDICE)
           MOVE ZEROES
             TO SWCV9951-D-CBALC(SWCV9951-INDICE)
           MOVE SPACES
             TO SWCV9951-D-CCCB(SWCV9951-INDICE)
           MOVE SPACES
             TO SWCV9951-D-CMOED(SWCV9951-INDICE)
           MOVE ZEROES
             TO SWCV9951-D-TOPREC(SWCV9951-INDICE)
           MOVE ZEROES
             TO SWCV9951-D-TOPRECV(SWCV9951-INDICE)
           MOVE ZEROES
             TO SWCV9951-D-TOPPEND(SWCV9951-INDICE)
           MOVE ZEROES
             TO SWCV9951-D-TOPPENDV(SWCV9951-INDICE)
           MOVE SPACES
             TO SWCV9951-D-CBAN(SWCV9951-INDICE)
           MOVE SPACES
             TO SWCV9951-D-CSPAI(SWCV9951-INDICE).
      *
       1199-LIMPA-OCCURS-EXIT.
           EXIT.
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *            2000-PROC-PROGRAMA
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       2000-PROC-PROGRAMA.
      *
           IF VIAL0001-DEBUG-SIM
              MOVE '2000-PROC-PROGRAMA' TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID
              PERFORM VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.
      *
           MOVE SWCV9950-NOMEFXLS          TO SWCV9951-NOMEFXLS .
           MOVE SWCV9950-NMAXLIST          TO SWCV9951-NMAXLIST .
           MOVE SWCV9950-CSEND-PAG         TO SWCV9951-CSEND-PAG.
           MOVE SWCV9950-CBAN-PAG          TO SWCV9951-CBAN-PAG .
           MOVE SWCV9950-CSPAI-PAG         TO SWCV9951-CSPAI-PAG.
           MOVE SWCV9950-CSEND             TO SWCV9951-CSEND    .
           MOVE SWCV9950-CBAN              TO SWCV9951-CBAN     .
           MOVE SWCV9950-CSPAI             TO SWCV9951-CSPAI    .
      *
           PERFORM 2010-VALIDACOES
              THRU 2019-VALIDACOES-EXIT.
      *
           IF VIAL0002-SEM-ERROS
              PERFORM 2020-OPEN
                 THRU 2029-OPEN-EXIT
           END-IF.
      *
           IF VIAL0002-SEM-ERROS
              PERFORM 2030-FETCH
                 THRU 2039-FETCH-EXIT

              IF VIAL0002-SEM-ERROS
                 IF DB2-OK
                    PERFORM 2040-CONTINUA
                       THRU 2049-CONTINUA-EXIT
                 ELSE
                    COMPUTE SWCV9951-DIMINUI-LENGTH EQUAL
                         SWCV9951-INDICE-INVERSO * SWCV9951-LENGTH-OCCUR
                    COMPUTE SWCV9951-LENGTH EQUAL SWCV9951-LENGTH
                         - SWCV9951-DIMINUI-LENGTH
                    MOVE VIAK0002-ERROS-FUNCAO
                                           TO VIAL0002-IND-ERROS
                 END-IF
              END-IF
              PERFORM 2070-CLOSE
                 THRU 2079-CLOSE-EXIT
           END-IF.
      *
       2099-PROC-PROGRAMA-EXIT.
           EXIT.
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *                   2010-VALIDACOES
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       2010-VALIDACOES.
      *
           IF VIAL0001-DEBUG-SIM
              MOVE '2010-VALIDACOES' TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID
              PERFORM VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.
      *
           IF SWCV9950-CSEND NOT EQUAL SPACES
              MOVE SWCV9950-CSEND           TO WS-CSEND
              IF SWCV9950-CBAN EQUAL SPACES
                 MOVE WS-CBAN               TO SWCV9950-CBAN
              END-IF
              IF SWCV9950-CSPAI EQUAL SPACES
                 MOVE WS-CSPAI              TO SWCV9950-CSPAI
              END-IF
           ELSE
               MOVE SWCV9950-CBAN           TO WS-CBAN
               MOVE SWCV9950-CSPAI          TO WS-CSPAI
               MOVE WS-CSEND                TO SWCV9950-CSEND
           END-IF.
      *
       2019-VALIDACOES-EXIT.
           EXIT.
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *                     2020-OPEN
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       2020-OPEN.
      *
           IF VIAL0001-DEBUG-SIM
              MOVE '2020-OPEN' TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID
              PERFORM VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.
      *  PAG
           MOVE SWCV9950-CBAN              TO NCCCBCOR-NCCCCBAN
           MOVE SWCV9950-CSPAI             TO NCCCBCOR-NCCCCSPAI
           MOVE SPACES                     TO NCCCBCOR-NCCCMOED
      *  FILTROS
           MOVE 'NCCCBCOR-NCCCCBAN       ' TO VIAL0015-CAMPO-NM (1)
           MOVE  NCCCBCOR-NCCCCBAN         TO VIAL0015-CAMPO-VLR(1)
           PERFORM VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG
              THRU VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           MOVE 'NCCCBCOR-NCCCCSPAI      ' TO VIAL0015-CAMPO-NM (1)
           MOVE  NCCCBCOR-NCCCCSPAI        TO VIAL0015-CAMPO-VLR(1)
           PERFORM VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG
              THRU VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           MOVE 'NCCCBCOR-NCCCMOED       ' TO VIAL0015-CAMPO-NM (1)
           MOVE  NCCCBCOR-NCCCMOED         TO VIAL0015-CAMPO-VLR(1)
           PERFORM VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG
              THRU VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
      *
           SET SW-CURSOR-NONE TO TRUE
      *
           IF SW-CURSOR-NONE
              SET SW-CURSOR-1 TO TRUE
           END-IF
      *
           EVALUATE TRUE
               WHEN SW-CURSOR-1
                    EXEC SQL
                        OPEN CURSWT01
                    END-EXEC
           END-EVALUATE.
      *
           MOVE CON-SWVT5805               TO VIAL0002-TABLE-NAME.
      *
           PERFORM 9020-DB2CHECK
              THRU 9029-DB2CHECK-EXIT.
      *
       2029-OPEN-EXIT.
           EXIT.
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *                     2030-FETCH
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       2030-FETCH.
      *
           IF VIAL0001-DEBUG-SIM
              MOVE '2030-FETCH' TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID
              PERFORM VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.
      *
           EVALUATE TRUE
               WHEN SW-CURSOR-1
                    EXEC SQL
                       FETCH CURSWT01
                       INTO :NCCCBCOR-NCCCBALC
                          , :NCCCBCOR-NCCCCCB
                          , :NCCCBCOR-NCCCMOED
                    END-EXEC
           END-EVALUATE.
      *
           MOVE CON-SWVT5805               TO VIAL0002-TABLE-NAME.
      *
           PERFORM 9020-DB2CHECK
              THRU 9029-DB2CHECK-EXIT.
      *
           MOVE '2030-FETCH AAA'           TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID
           MOVE 'VIAW0005-SQLCODE        ' TO VIAL0015-CAMPO-NM (1)
           MOVE  VIAW0005-SQLCODE          TO VIAL0015-CAMPO-VLR(1)
           PERFORM VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG
              THRU VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT.
      *
           MOVE '2030-FETCH ZZZ'           TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID
           MOVE 'NCCCBCOR-NCCCCBAN       ' TO VIAL0015-CAMPO-NM (1)
           MOVE  NCCCBCOR-NCCCCBAN         TO VIAL0015-CAMPO-VLR(1)

           MOVE 'NCCCBCOR-NCCCCSPAI      ' TO VIAL0015-CAMPO-NM (2)
           MOVE  NCCCBCOR-NCCCCSPAI        TO VIAL0015-CAMPO-VLR(2)

           MOVE 'NCCCBCOR-NCCCMOED       ' TO VIAL0015-CAMPO-NM (3)
           MOVE  NCCCBCOR-NCCCMOED         TO VIAL0015-CAMPO-VLR(3)

           PERFORM VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG
              THRU VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
      *
       2039-FETCH-EXIT.
           EXIT.
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *                       2040-CONTINUA
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       2040-CONTINUA.
      *
           IF VIAL0001-DEBUG-SIM
              MOVE '2040-CONTINUA' TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID
              PERFORM VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.
      *
           MOVE ZEROES                     TO SWCV9951-INDICE.
           PERFORM 2050-TRATA-OCCURS
              THRU 2059-TRATA-OCCURS-EXIT
             UNTIL DB2-NOTFND
                OR SWCV9951-PAGINA-CHEIA
                OR NOT VIAL0002-SEM-ERROS.
      *
           IF VIAL0002-SEM-ERROS
              IF NOT SWCV9951-PAGINA-CHEIA
                    COMPUTE SWCV9951-INDICE-INVERSO EQUAL
                         SWCV9951-INDICE-INVERSO - SWCV9951-INDICE
                    COMPUTE SWCV9951-DIMINUI-LENGTH EQUAL
                         SWCV9951-INDICE-INVERSO * SWCV9951-LENGTH-OCCUR
                    COMPUTE SWCV9951-LENGTH EQUAL SWCV9951-LENGTH -
                         SWCV9951-DIMINUI-LENGTH
                    SET  VIAL0002-FIM-CONSULTA TO TRUE
              END-IF
              IF DB2-NOTFND
                    SET  VIAL0002-FIM-CONSULTA TO TRUE
              END-IF
           END-IF.
      *
       2049-CONTINUA-EXIT.
           EXIT.
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *            2050-TRATA-OCCURS
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       2050-TRATA-OCCURS.
      *
           IF VIAL0001-DEBUG-SIM
              MOVE '2050-TRATA-OCCURS' TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID
              PERFORM VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.
      *
           ADD 1                       TO SWCV9951-INDICE.
      *
           MOVE SWCV9950-CBAN          TO WS-CBAN.
           MOVE SWCV9950-CSPAI         TO WS-CSPAI.
           MOVE WS-CSEND
             TO SWCV9951-D-CSEND(SWCV9951-INDICE).
           MOVE NCCCBCOR-NCCCBALC
             TO SWCV9951-D-CBALC(SWCV9951-INDICE).
           MOVE NCCCBCOR-NCCCCCB
             TO SWCV9951-D-CCCB(SWCV9951-INDICE).
           MOVE NCCCBCOR-NCCCMOED
             TO SWCV9951-D-CMOED(SWCV9951-INDICE).
      *  OBTEM NUMERO E SUMATORIO DE RECONCILIADOS
PML        MOVE CON-RS                     TO WS-CODEST1.
PML        MOVE CON-RC                     TO WS-CODEST2.
           PERFORM 2310-OBTEM-COUNT-SUM
              THRU 2310-OBTEM-COUNT-SUM-EXIT.
           MOVE WS-COUNT
PRA   *      TO SWCV9951-D-TOPREC(SWCV9951-INDICE).
PRA          TO SWCV9951-D-TOPPEND(SWCV9951-INDICE).
           MOVE WS-SUM
PRA   *      TO SWCV9951-D-TOPRECV(SWCV9951-INDICE).
PRA          TO SWCV9951-D-TOPPENDV(SWCV9951-INDICE).
      *  OBTEM NUMERO E SUMATORIO DE NAO RECONCILIADOS
PML        MOVE CON-PD                     TO WS-CODEST1.
           MOVE SPACES                     TO WS-CODEST2.
           PERFORM 2310-OBTEM-COUNT-SUM
              THRU 2310-OBTEM-COUNT-SUM-EXIT.
           MOVE WS-COUNT
PRA   *      TO SWCV9951-D-TOPPEND(SWCV9951-INDICE).
PRA          TO SWCV9951-D-TOPREC(SWCV9951-INDICE).
           MOVE WS-SUM
PRA   *      TO SWCV9951-D-TOPPENDV(SWCV9951-INDICE).
PRA          TO SWCV9951-D-TOPRECV(SWCV9951-INDICE).
      *
           MOVE SWCV9950-CBAN
             TO SWCV9951-D-CBAN(SWCV9951-INDICE).
           MOVE SWCV9950-CSPAI
             TO SWCV9951-D-CSPAI(SWCV9951-INDICE).
      *
           PERFORM 2320-DESC-CSEND
              THRU 2320-DESC-CSEND-EXIT.
      *
           PERFORM 2030-FETCH
              THRU 2039-FETCH-EXIT.
      *
       2059-TRATA-OCCURS-EXIT.
           EXIT.
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *            2310-OBTEM-COUNT-SUM
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       2310-OBTEM-COUNT-SUM.
      *
           IF VIAL0001-DEBUG-SIM
              MOVE '2310-OBTEM-COUNT-SUM. ' TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID
              PERFORM VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.
      *
           MOVE ZEROES                     TO WS-COUNT.
           MOVE ZEROES                     TO WS-SUM  .
      *
           EXEC SQL
                SELECT COUNT(*)
                     , IFNULL(SUM(MVALOR), 0)
                  INTO :WS-COUNT
                     , :WS-SUM
                  FROM SWVT5805
PML              WHERE CCODEST IN (:WS-CODEST1, :WS-CODEST2)
                   AND CBAN  = :NCCCBCOR-NCCCCBAN
                   AND CSPAI = :NCCCBCOR-NCCCCSPAI
                   AND CMOED = :NCCCBCOR-NCCCMOED
           END-EXEC.
      *
           MOVE CON-SWVT5805               TO VIAL0002-TABLE-NAME.
      *
           PERFORM 9020-DB2CHECK
              THRU 9029-DB2CHECK-EXIT.
      *
           MOVE '2310-OBTEM-COUNT-SUM'     TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID

           MOVE 'WS-CODEST1              ' TO VIAL0015-CAMPO-NM (1)
           MOVE  WS-CODEST1                TO VIAL0015-CAMPO-VLR(1)

           MOVE 'WS-CODEST2              ' TO VIAL0015-CAMPO-NM (2)
           MOVE  WS-CODEST2                TO VIAL0015-CAMPO-VLR(2)

           PERFORM VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG
              THRU VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT

           MOVE 'WS-COUNT                ' TO VIAL0015-CAMPO-NM (1)
           MOVE  WS-COUNT                  TO VIAL0015-CAMPO-VLR(1)

           MOVE 'WS-SUM                  ' TO VIAL0015-CAMPO-NM (2)
           MOVE  WS-SUM                    TO VIAL0015-CAMPO-VLR(2)

           PERFORM VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG
              THRU VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT

           MOVE 'NCCCBCOR-NCCCCBAN       ' TO VIAL0015-CAMPO-NM (1)
           MOVE  NCCCBCOR-NCCCCBAN         TO VIAL0015-CAMPO-VLR(1)

           MOVE 'NCCCBCOR-NCCCCSPAI      ' TO VIAL0015-CAMPO-NM (2)
           MOVE  NCCCBCOR-NCCCCSPAI        TO VIAL0015-CAMPO-VLR(2)

           MOVE 'NCCCBCOR-NCCCMOED       ' TO VIAL0015-CAMPO-NM (3)
           MOVE  NCCCBCOR-NCCCMOED         TO VIAL0015-CAMPO-VLR(3)

           PERFORM VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG
              THRU VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
      *
           MOVE SPACES                     TO WS-CODEST1.
           MOVE SPACES                     TO WS-CODEST2.
      *
       2310-OBTEM-COUNT-SUM-EXIT.
           EXIT.
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *            2320-DESC-CSEND
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       2320-DESC-CSEND.
      *
           IF VIAL0001-DEBUG-SIM
              MOVE '2320-DESC-CSEND    ' TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID
              PERFORM VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.
      *
           INITIALIZE SXCL0790-DATA
                      SXCL0002-COMMAREA.

           MOVE VIAL0001-VERSAO-SYS    TO SXCL0790-VERSAO
           MOVE SWCV9950-CBAN          TO SXCL0790-BCBAN
           MOVE CON-VALIDO             TO SXCL0790-BSITU

           PERFORM CALL-SXRM0790
              THRU CALL-SXRM0790-EXIT.

           MOVE SXCL0790-RCODE         TO VIAW0020-RCODE

           PERFORM VIAP0020-TRATA-RCODE
              THRU VIAP0020-TRATA-RCODE-EXIT.

           IF VIAL0002-SEM-ERROS
              MOVE SXCL0790-BDBAN
                         TO SWCV9951-D-DESCSEND(SWCV9951-INDICE)
           END-IF.
      *
       2320-DESC-CSEND-EXIT.
           EXIT.
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *                     2070-CLOSE
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       2070-CLOSE.
      *
           IF VIAL0001-DEBUG-SIM
              MOVE '2070-CLOSE' TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID
              PERFORM VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.
      *
           EVALUATE TRUE
               WHEN SW-CURSOR-1
                    EXEC SQL
                        CLOSE CURSWT01
                    END-EXEC
           END-EVALUATE.
      *
       2079-CLOSE-EXIT.
           EXIT.
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *            3000-FINAL-PROGRAMA
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       3000-FINAL-PROGRAMA.
      *
           IF VIAL0001-DEBUG-SIM
              MOVE '3000-FINAL-PROGRAMA' TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID
              PERFORM VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.
      *
           IF SWCV9950-NMAXLIST EQUAL ZEROES
              MOVE VIAL0001-CAPLIC         TO ARCL0039-CAPLIC
              MOVE VIAL0001-COPCAO         TO ARCL0039-COPCAO
              PERFORM ARCR0039-NMAXLIST
                 THRU ARCR0039-NMAXLIST-EXIT

              IF ETCL0002-ABEND-DB2
                 MOVE ETCL0002-TABLE-NAME  TO VIAL0002-TABLE-NAME
                 MOVE ETCL0002-SQLCA       TO VIAL0002-SQLCA
              END-IF

              MOVE ARCL0039-NMAXLIST       TO SWCV9951-NMAXLIST
           ELSE
              MOVE SWCV9950-NMAXLIST       TO SWCV9951-NMAXLIST
           END-IF.
      *
           MOVE SWCV9951-MSG               TO VIAL0001-MENSAGEM-OUTPUT.
           MOVE SWCV9951-LENGTH            TO VIAL0001-LENGTH-MSG.
           MOVE SWCV9951-NR-CAMPOS         TO VIAL0001-NR-CAMPOS.
           MOVE SWCV9951-INDICE            TO VIAL0001-OCORRENCIAS.
      *
       3099-FINAL-PROGRAMA-EXIT.
           EXIT.
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
           EXEC SQL INCLUDE VIAP0003 END-EXEC.
      *==============================================================
           COPY VIAP0016.
           COPY ARCR0039.
           COPY TGCP1000.
           COPY SXCR0790.
           COPY VIAP0020.

